  - Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - cryptocurrency
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - quantum-resistant
  - privacy
  - zk-STARK
  - ML-KEM
  - proof of work
  - atomic swaps
  - Bitcoin
date-released: "2026-11-03"
